106,"end":108,"surface":"太戊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000109","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"中衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000321","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p004","text":"非子居犬丘，好馬及畜，善養息之。犬丘人言之周孝王，孝王召使主馬于汧渭之間，馬大蕃息。孝王欲以為大駱適嗣。申侯之女為大駱妻，生子成為適。申侯乃言孝王曰：「昔我先酈山之女，為戎胥軒妻，生中潏，以親故歸周，保西垂，西垂以其故和睦。今我復與大駱妻，生適子成。申駱重婚，西戎皆服，所以為王。王其圖之。」於是孝王曰：「昔伯翳為舜主畜，畜多息，故有土，賜姓嬴。今其後世亦為朕息馬，朕其分土為附庸。」邑之秦，使復續嬴氏祀，號曰秦嬴。亦不廢申侯之女子為駱適者，以和西戎。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"非子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000334","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"周孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000206","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000206","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000206","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"大駱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000333","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"申侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000335","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000366","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"大駱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000333","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000336","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i