"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000366","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064","text":"太史公曰：秦之先伯翳，嘗有勳於唐虞之際，受土賜姓。及殷夏之閒微散。至周之衰，秦興，邑于西垂。自繆公以來，稍蠶食諸侯，竟成始皇。始皇自以為功過五帝，地廣三王，而羞與之侔。善哉乎賈生推言之也！曰：","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"伯翳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000316","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"唐虞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"三王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:m0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"賈生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000614","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p030","text":"舜之後，周武王封之陳，至楚惠王滅之，有世家言。禹之後，周武王封之杞，楚惠王滅之，有世家言。契之後為殷，殷有本紀言。殷破，周封其後於宋，齊湣王滅之，有世家言。后稷之後為周，秦昭王滅之，有本紀言。皋陶之後，或封英、六，楚穆王滅之，無譜。伯夷之後，至周武王復封於齊，曰太公望，陳氏滅之，有世家言。伯翳之後，至周平王時封為秦，項羽滅之，有本紀言。垂、益、夔、龍，其後不知所封，不見也。右十一人者，皆唐虞之際名有功德臣也；其五人之後皆至帝王，餘乃為顯諸侯。滕、薛、騶，夏、殷、周之閒封也，小，不足齒列，弗論也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"楚惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001415","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"楚惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001415","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"齊湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001530","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000308","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-